    "title": "Calling on all South Euclid City Council candidates -- for January - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jeff Piorkowski ,\n36 minutes ago South Euclid City Council, come January, will have one, or possibly two, open seats. A resident pointed this out during Tuesday's (Sept. 23) council meeting in hopes of getting prospective candidates to start thinking about putting their hats in the ring for consideration. Council members will choose the one or two replacements in January. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
